								<wikidot:authorUserId>1313607</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Not quite clear on how this fits into the whole&#8212; but I didn't care. Once again, reading I felt submerged in the rich, well-realized world, and the characters had very clear thought-patterns and voices. Clever, clever dialogue, and lofty/foreboding pronouncements that didn't sound stupid (which is a big pet peeve of mine).</p> 
				 	]]>
