					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Very intriguing. The fact that I wasn't familiar with W.S's play (Shame on me) somehow hurt my enjoyment of the first half, but the imagery near the ending was more than enough to catch my attention again. Also, considering how 921 was one of the first SCPs I've ever read, it was certainly interesting to see it being revised for the contest.</p> <p>Looking forward to the next installments!</p> 
				 	]]>
